              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">hygh-tec drainage fecal management system</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Reshaping fecal incontinence care</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The hygh-tec drainage system combines innovative design and materials to support improved fecal management performance.<sup>1</sup>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Rx only.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
